  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals engaged in political, philosophical, or social discourse around human rights and minority rights, particularly those who are familiar with or interested in concepts of individual rights as foundational to collective rights. The meme appeals to an audience that values logical argumentation, rhetorical persuasion, and moral philosophy, likely including academics, activists, policymakers, and informed citizens who are debating or reflecting on the nature of rights and protections in society. The visual of the earnest speaker reinforces the appeal to a community that responds to thoughtful, principled messaging.",
